WEBVTT

01:01:21.542 --> 01:01:22.667
And I met a girl.

01:01:23.375 --> 01:01:24.459
I met her and came back home.

01:01:24.959 --> 01:01:27.292
I sat down to write his name
but I can't stop thinking about her.

01:01:27.792 --> 01:01:28.709
I'm not able to pen down the name.

01:01:30.834 --> 01:01:32.084
I can't seem to understand why.
